    <string name="llmkey_hint_chat_missing_body">The Tutor replies using your LLM service key. Add it in Settings, then come back: what you\'re writing stays in the field.</string>
    <string name="llmkey_hint_chat_rejected_body">The Tutor can\'t reply until you replace it. What you write stays in the field.</string>
